Usingletin a loop:

In the first example, usingvar, the variable declared in 
the loop redeclares the variable outside the loop.

In the second example, usinglet, the variable declared in 
the loop does not redeclare the variable outside the loop.

Whenletis used to declare the i variable in a loop, the i 
variable will only be visible within the loop.

### Code Snippets

```
for (
exp 1
;
exp 2
;
exp 3
) {
//
code block to be executed
}

---

